==Spanish==

===Etymology===
{{compound|a|t1=to|bajo|t2=down|lang=es}}

Cognate to {{etyl|fr|-}} {{term|à bas|lang=fr}}, which is also used in sense “[[down with]]”.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Es-am-lat-abajo.ogg|Audio (Latin America)|lang=es}}

===Adverb===
{{es-adv}}

# [[down]]
# [[downstairs]]
#: '''''Abajo''' están la cocina y el salón'' — “The kitchen and lounge are downstairs.”
# [[below]]

